# Live DocuSign layout for examples/full-service-demo/.env - exactly what
# `make docusign-env` writes (repo root). Every value here is DUMMY data in
# the real shape; replace all of it. Setup + consent: docs/integration/docusign-proxy.md
PORT=4100
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://dev:dev@localhost:5432/esign

# Local dev: no JWT_SECRET, so the bearer token IS the user id (what the
# live specs send). Production: set JWT_SECRET and drop ALLOW_INSECURE_DEV.
ALLOW_INSECURE_DEV=true
# JWT_SECRET=9f2c6b1e4d8a7c3f5e0b2a9d6c4f8e1a

ESIGN_PROVIDER=docusign
# Connect webhook HMAC key (Admin → Connect → the configuration's HMAC key)
DOCUSIGN_HMAC_KEY=c2e9a4d7f1b8e6c3a5d9f2b7e4c1a8d6

# Admin → Apps and Keys: "My Account Information" panel (User ID, API Account ID)
# and the app's Integration Key. All three are GUIDs.
DOCUSIGN_ACCOUNT_ID=7d3e5f21-8a4b-4c6d-9e0f-1a2b3c4d5e6f
DOCUSIGN_INTEGRATION_KEY=2b8c4d6e-1f3a-4b5c-8d7e-9f0a1b2c3d4e
DOCUSIGN_USER_ID=5a1c9e3d-7b2f-4e8a-b6c4-d0e2f4a6b8c1
# Templates → a template's details page URL carries its id (proxy mode envelopes)
DOCUSIGN_TEMPLATE_ID=c4d6e8f0-2a1b-4c3d-9e8f-7a6b5c4d3e2f
# Web Forms builder → the form's id (Web Forms mode; the capability test form
# v2 in docs/integration/webforms.md is c640d957-a2d0-4e36-9975-5374afb02b54)
DOCUSIGN_WEBFORM_ID=c640d957-a2d0-4e36-9975-5374afb02b54
DOCUSIGN_WEBFORMS_BASE_URL=https://apps-d.docusign.com/api/webforms/v1.1
# Where DocuSign sends the signer after a Web Forms instance (the bridge page)
DOCUSIGN_RETURN_URL=http://localhost:4100/signing/return
# Defaults target the developer (demo) environment; production:
# DOCUSIGN_BASE_URL=https://na4.docusign.net/restapi
# DOCUSIGN_OAUTH_URL=https://account.docusign.com
# DOCUSIGN_WEBFORMS_BASE_URL=https://apps.docusign.com/api/webforms/v1.1

# The private half of the RSA keypair whose public half is uploaded on the
# integration key. Multi-line, double-quoted (dotenv handles it; direnv does
# not - the service loads .env itself). `make docusign-env PEM=path` inlines
# a file for you. This one is NOT a key.
DOCUSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----
MIIEpAIBAAKCAQEA0EXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLE
EXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEX
...(a real 2048-bit key is 25 lines of 64 base64 characters; keep them verbatim)...
EXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEX
-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----"
